= Portal Architecture Specification =
== From Wikipedia Systems Research to BITwiki Navigation Framework ==

'''Version:''' 2.0 | '''Date:''' 2026-02-12 | '''Source:''' Wikipedia Systems Research

----
== Executive Summary ==

This specification integrates Wikipedia Systems portal architecture research into BITwiki's navigation framework. Analysis of interconnected Wikipedia portals reveals patterns for hub-and-spoke navigation, progressive disclosure, and cross-domain linking that inform BITwiki's portal system design.

=== Key Research Findings ===

| Metric | Wikipedia Pattern | BITwiki Adaptation |
|--------|-------------------|-------------------|
| Section Flexibility | 13 average, variable | Context-dependent structure |
| Category Depth | 4-5 levels | Scalable taxonomy |
| Portal Connectivity | 20 average links | Rich interconnection |
| Taxonomy Structure | Hierarchical | Adaptive hierarchy |

----
== 1. Portal Architecture Principles ==

=== 1.1 Core Design Philosophy ===

'''Wikipedia Pattern:''' Hub-and-spoke with progressive disclosure

'''BITwiki Implementation:'''
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ BITWIKI PORTAL ARCHITECTURE │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ │
│ ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ │
│ │ META HUBS │───→│ DOMAIN PORTALS│───→│ TOPICAL PORTALS│ │
│ │ │ │ │ │ │ │
│ │ • Systems │ │ • Science │ │ • Networks │ │
│ │ • Research │ │ • Technology │ │ • Complexity │ │
│ │ • Knowledge │ │ • Humanities │ │ • Cybernetics│ │
│ └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘ │
│ │ │ │ │
│ └───────────────────┼───────────────────┘ │
│ ↓ │
│ ┌──────────────┐ │
│ │ CROSS-LINKS │ │
│ │ (Rich mesh) │ │
│ └──────────────┘ │
│ │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

=== 1.2 Portal Types ===

| Type | Description | Examples | Characteristics |
|------|-------------|----------|-----------------|
| '''Meta Hub''' | Root navigation nodes | Systems Science, Research Methods | Multi-domain coverage, broad scope |
| '''Domain Portal''' | Subject area hubs | Complexity Science, Network Science | Domain focus with adjacent connections |
| '''Topical Portal''' | Specific topic focus | Network Theory, Cybernetics | Thematic depth, specialized content |
| '''Functional Portal''' | Process/Method oriented | Quantitative Methods, Analysis | Methodology-centered |
| '''Temporal Portal''' | Time-based organization | History of Systems, Evolution | Chronological structure |
| '''Comparative Portal''' | Cross-domain synthesis | Comparative Analysis, Integration | Multi-perspective views |

