== 2. Portal Structure Framework ==

=== 2.1 Flexible Section Architecture ===

'''Based on Wikipedia Analysis:'''

| Section | Priority | Content Type | Purpose |
|---------|----------|--------------|---------|
| '''Introduction''' | Required | Static overview | Establish context |
| '''Selected Content''' | Required | Rotating featured content | Showcase quality |
| '''Categories''' | Required | Taxonomy navigation | Structural access |
| '''Related Portals''' | Required | Cross-domain links | Network navigation |
| '''Selected Biography''' | Recommended | People highlights | Human dimension |
| '''Current Developments''' | Recommended | Recent updates | Temporal relevance |
| '''Topics''' | Recommended | Sub-domain index | Granular access |
| '''Resources''' | Optional | Curated materials | Deep engagement |
| '''References''' | Optional | Key sources | Verification |
| '''External Links''' | Optional | Outbound resources | Extended context |

'''Section Content Specifications:'''

==== Introduction Section ====
```markdown
{{Portal:Introduction
 | name = Systems Science
 | image = Systems_Science_Diagram.svg
 | description = Systems science is an interdisciplinary field that studies 
 complex systems and their behaviors.
 | scope = Includes complexity theory, cybernetics, network science, 
 and dynamical systems
 | parent = [[Portal:Research_Methods]]
}}
```

==== Selected Content Section ====
```markdown
{{Portal:SelectedArticle
 | article = [[Topic:Complexity_Theory]]
 | excerpt = Complexity theory studies how complex systems emerge from 
 simple interactions, revealing patterns across biology, 
 economics, and technology.
 | image = Complexity_Network.png
}}
```

==== Categories Section ====
```markdown
{{Portal:Categories
 | root = Systems Science
 | depth = adaptive
 | display = tree
}}
```

==== Related Portals Section ====
```markdown
{{Portal:Related
 | parent = [[Portal:Research_Methods]]
 | siblings = [[Portal:Mathematics]], [[Portal:Computer_Science]]
 | children = [[Portal:Network_Analysis]], [[Portal:Complexity_Modeling]]
 | related = [[Portal:Cybernetics]], [[Portal:Information_Theory]]
}}
```

