== 6. Technical Implementation ==

=== 6.1 MediaWiki Configuration ===

```php
// LocalSettings.php additions for BITwiki portals

// Enable portal namespace
$wgExtraNamespaces[100] = "Portal";
$wgExtraNamespaces[101] = "Portal_talk";

// Portal-specific settings
$wgPortalNavigationCacheExpiry = 3600; // 1 hour
$wgPortalSelectedArticlePoolSize = 50;
$wgPortalAutoRotationEnabled = true;
```

=== 6.2 Template Structure ===

```markdown
<!-- Template:Portal header -->
{{Portal header
 | name = {{{name}}}
 | image = {{{image}}}
 | description = {{{description}}}
 | parent = {{{parent}}}
}}

<!-- Template:Portal selected article -->
{{Portal selected article
 | article = {{{article}}}
 | excerpt = {{{excerpt}}}
 | image = {{{image}}}
}}

<!-- Template:Portal categories -->
{{Portal categories
 | root = {{{root_category}}}
 | depth = adaptive
}}

<!-- Template:Portal related -->
{{Portal related
 | portals = {{{portal_list}}}
}}
```

