== 7. Maintenance & Governance ==

=== 7.1 Portal Maintenance Roles ===

| Role | Responsibilities | Frequency |
|------|-----------------|-----------|
| '''Portal Curator''' | Content selection, quality review | Ongoing |
| '''Taxonomy Steward''' | Category management, restructuring | As needed |
| '''Link Manager''' | Cross-portal link maintenance | Periodic |
| '''Technical Admin''' | Template updates, automation | As needed |

=== 7.2 Quality Indicators ===

| Metric | Indicator | Measurement |
|--------|-----------|-------------|
| Portal freshness | Content currency | Update frequency |
| Link validity | Connection health | Working cross-portal links |
| Category coverage | Taxonomic completeness | Article categorization |
| User engagement | Interaction depth | Time on portal pages |

